Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.10,0:00:04.21,English,en-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}Marching as one army aims to reduce arrangements along the way.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.10,0:00:04.26,Chinese,zh-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}整军直走，争取少做中途安排；分兵休整
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.21,0:00:08.44,English,en-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}Splitting to rest takes time at separate stations and to regroup.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:04.26,0:00:08.42,Chinese,zh-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}，要付出分开驻留和重新会合的时间；换
Dialogue: 2,0:00:08.42,0:00:12.36,Chinese,zh-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}路线，则要走完预先选好的中转路径。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.44,0:00:12.55,English,en-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}Rerouting requires completing the chosen sequence of waypoints.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.36,0:00:16.37,Chinese,zh-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}比较这三种安排时，要从同一个普通存档出
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.55,0:00:15.42,English,en-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}To compare these plans, start from the same
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.42,0:00:17.62,English,en-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}normal save and head for the same
Dialogue: 2,0:00:16.37,0:00:20.39,Chinese,zh-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}发，前往同一个目的地，分别记录各自真实
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.62,0:00:18.42,English,en-5,0,0,0,,{\q2}destination.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.42,0:00:21.22,English,en-6,0,0,0,,{\q2}Record each plan's actual arrival outcome,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:20.39,0:00:24.41,Chinese,zh-5,0,0,0,,{\q2}到场的结果，再看同一天各队分别在哪里。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.22,0:00:24.21,English,en-7,0,0,0,,{\q2}then compare where the armies are on the same
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.21,0:00:24.48,English,en-8,0,0,0,,{\q2}day.
